            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christina"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was nice for a change! This dressing has a very fresh flavor, and I liked that. I didn't have any white wine vinegar, so I used rice wine vinegar, and no peanut oil, so I subbed 1 tbsp. sesame oila dn 1 tbsp. canola oil...it gave this a nice, toasty flavor in the background. I made this earlier in the day to allow the flavors to blend. You can really taste each flavor, which is nice. Served this over a simple salad w/ chow mein noodles. Would make this again! Thanks for sharing. :)"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
