            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "angie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "so, I actually had to add about three times as much peanut oil to give it a more liquid consistency as it was otherwise lumps. it was very fresh and authentic. I did not find the ginger overwhelming. They don't say what size carrots to use but I used three medium sized carrots.",
